        <item>
            <title>OpenStill 0.0.3</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What’s new in 0.0.3</h3><ul><li>Select with AI: subject, background, people, individual people, face, eyes, eyebrows, lips, skin, sky and depth masks</li><li>Lens Blur: depth-driven background blur from camera depth, AI depth or the subject</li><li>AI RAW denoise that keeps every edit adjustable, and 2× super resolution</li><li>Smoother local AI results with no tile seams</li><li>Import from a memory card or folder with renaming, backups, presets and duplicate detection</li><li>Find exact and near-duplicate photos</li><li>Read and write XMP sidecars, and import Camera Raw settings</li><li>Import a Lightroom Classic catalog: folders, ratings, labels, keywords, collections and develop settings</li></ul>]]></description>
